0..78 Comment "// A true path the conversion cannot settle within its step budget is refused."
79..81 Comment "//"
82..161 Comment "// The refusal must say the budget ran out, never that the endpoints are apart."
162..237 Comment "// The point and the endpoints do convert, by a run longer than the budget."
238..240 Comment "//"
241..320 Comment "// Fibonacci\'s doubly recursive definition at nineteen spends the budget before"
321..400 Comment "// it meets the iterative one. So the machine declines, and the label names the"
401..411 Comment "// budget."
412..414 Comment "//"
415..430 Comment "// - see: #3139"
432..474 Comment "// The naturals, their addition and three."
